    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d555">

                <pb facs="0874" n="852" sameAs="frus:frus1951v02/pg852"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/12–1251: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States Representative at the United
                        Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Austin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-12-12T15:00:00+01:00">December 12,
                            1951—3 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p> Delga 623. Re USGADel decisions mtg 12 Dec. Re Indians in South Africa case,
                    approved position in Doc SD/A/C.1/360. Will avoid taking lead but seek develop
                    strong behind-scenes support for reopening discussion between parties. In
                    speeches USGADel will make clear moral position US takes on issue of human
                    rights in this and other cases.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
